  (text "Note: USB-PD sink (CH224A, 32 V-tolerant), requests 9 V via R3=6.8k; 24k = 12 V." (at 32.8 129.19 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0) italic) (justify left)) (uuid 3377b0d9-9d3a-4c5b-877c-32a49f7c2da9))
  (text "Note: 9 V request. Use 24k (C25769) for 12 V. NEVER leave open (=20 V)." (at 32.8 174.91 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0) italic) (justify left)) (uuid 0fedb3a4-dbf4-4e0f-8c6d-ad0a53004660))
  (text "Note: Solder pads to share one USB-C supply between 2-3 boards" (at 32.8 270.16 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0) italic) (justify left)) (uuid 6797f8e3-6df6-4d6c-afef-048467718e93))
  (text "Note: Both H-bridges paralleled (A||B) for 2.4 A avg" (at 202.98 107.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0) italic) (justify left)) (uuid 150f5557-b4c3-41ba-a406-c68897b3adb9))
  (text "Note: Keeps driver in standby while ESP boots" (at 202.98 200.31 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0) italic) (justify left)) (uuid de02107a-620e-45bd-b0e9-587de907ceea))
  (text "Note: Hand-soldered (through-hole), supplied by you" (at 291.88 66.96000000000001 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0) italic) (justify left)) (uuid 1355d9de-88a5-4118-a717-3081a7c09345))
  (text "Note: Keeps wiper max ~3.0 V, inside the ADC's linear range" (at 291.88 91.09 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0) italic) (justify left)) (uuid b8c98301-550e-490f-a226-c0cae99d7bf0))
